===============================================================================
Lineage and Acknowledgements
===============================================================================

mpvZero is an independent lightweight Android media player tailored for dedicated
4K Remux direct-stream decoding and audiophile IEM headphone downmixing.

Its architectural lineage builds upon the work of several prior open-source projects:
- Mpv-infinity (https://github.com/ZHINFINITY/Mpv-infinity)
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later
- mpvRx (https://github.com/Riteshp2001/mpvRx)
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later
- mpvKt (https://github.com/husams/mpvKt)
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later
- mpvEx (https://github.com/marlboro-advance/mpvEx)
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
- mpv-android (https://github.com/mpv-android/mpv-android)
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later

